<title>SOUTH KOREA: Sam Yang seeks 16,000T of U.S. soybean.</title>
<headline>Sam Yang seeks 16,000T of U.S. soybean.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Sam Yang Foods Co Ltd said on Wednesday it will buy 16,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 soybean by the end of this week.</p>
<p>A Sam Yang official said shipment would be set for early November from the U.S. Gulf to South Korea's western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
